  "body": "Fork process files at PROCESS_VERSION 29 (fork synced at v0.18.0).\n\n## What changed\n\n- New `crates/ui/AGENTS.md`: a steering addendum for UI work. It restates existing laws and links each one to its source: layering (ui -> app -> flecs), Everything Is a Command, a setup's controls on its own page (#1104), the form seam (#1122, in progress), the 400-line rule, structural tests instead of pixel snapshots, and icon sources (#661). It adds no new rule.\n- Root `AGENTS.md`: one link line in the Assets section (\"UI work also follows `crates/ui/AGENTS.md`\"). `crates/ui/AGENTS.md` joins the process-file list and the `git checkout upstream/main -- ...` sync command, so forks sync it.\n- `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` 30 -> 31.\n- `docs/decisions/1121-ui-agents-md.md`: the decisions ledger for this PR.\n\n## Deviations from the issue\n\n- PROCESS_VERSION is 31, not 30: upstream main was already at 30 when this branch was cut (another process PR merged first).\n- Left out for lack of a source: the \"plain-English user text\" rule, and the \"our own SVG masters\" wording in the icon rule. Both are recorded in the decisions file.\n\n## Process announcement (for the merger, #681)\n\n`PROCESS_VERSION 31` · PR #M · crates/ui/AGENTS.md UI steering document, linked from AGENTS.md and added to the process sync list · forks: sync process files\n\n## Testing\n\nDocs and process only; no crates changed. `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main --dry-run` reports no tests to run.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #1121\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
